DESCRIPTION:Hi\, Gwen here\, I'm out of prison and\, no\, I don't have any 
 more bacon and egg flavoured vapes for sale! BUT\, this is my next venture\
 , I'll teach you how to become resilient\, gorgeous and gregarious through 
 my late night rambunctious extravaganza\, with dance music and interaction.
  Gwen was a finalist in the Sketch Off Awards 2025 and the winner of the Lu
 ke Rollason Character Bursary. Rachel Baker is a Big Value Act 2026\, Funny
  Women Finalist and Birmingham Breaking Talent nominee. As heard on BBC Rad
 io 4.\nMore info: https://comedyatlas.app/comedy-atlas/event/rachel-baker-p
 resents-gwen-this-is-not-a-pyramid-scheme/
